  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "\"preposition\": English prepositions seldom match one word in another language: *on Monday*, *in May*, and *at night* each take a different one. Some languages put a small word after the noun instead, so the idea of a word placed before may need explaining.",
